<title>JAPAN: Central Japan Railway to apply for share listing.</title>
<headline>Central Japan Railway to apply for share listing.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Japan Railway Co plans to submit a preliminary application to the Tokyo Stock Exchange in April for a share listing in the autumn, a company spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said president Yoshiyuki Kasai made those plans known during a news conference on Friday.</p>
<p>Central Japan Railway is one of six firms created from the break-up of the former national railway company.</p>
